MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 D_funCall
HSTORE TEMP 8 0 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 26 TEMP 8
HSTORE TEMP 7 0 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 7
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 6 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 0
MOVE TEMP 27 2
MOVE TEMP 28 3
MOVE TEMP 29 4
MOVE TEMP 30 CALL TEMP 10 ( TEMP 6 TEMP 27 TEMP 28 TEMP 29 )
PRINT TEMP 30
END
D_funCall [ 4 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 31 8
MOVE TEMP 32 HALLOCATE TEMP 31
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 33 8
MOVE TEMP 34 HALLOCATE TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 35 A_funA
HSTORE TEMP 12 0 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 36 A_funA2
HSTORE TEMP 12 4 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 37 0
MOVE TEMP 38 TEMP 37
HSTORE TEMP 11 4 TEMP 38
MOVE TEMP 39 TEMP 12
HSTORE TEMP 11 0 TEMP 39
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 13 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 0
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 14 0
MOVE TEMP 40 CALL TEMP 15 ( TEMP 13 TEMP 1 TEMP 2 TEMP 3 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 40
PRINT TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 3
PRINT TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 16 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 16 0
HLOAD TEMP 18 TEMP 17 4
MOVE TEMP 41 CALL TEMP 18 ( TEMP 16 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 41
PRINT TEMP 4

RETURN TEMP 4
END
A_funA [ 4 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 42 100
MOVE TEMP 43 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 42
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 43
MOVE TEMP 44 10
MOVE TEMP 45 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 44
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 45
MOVE TEMP 46 PLUS TEMP 1 TEMP 2
